{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Exclude custom output directories from automatic pruning**\n\nA custom `--out` directly under `runs_dir()` has a nonnumeric marker, so it sorts first and becomes a pruning candidate. `prepare_out()` holds a different lock from `prune_runs()`, allowing another checkout to delete that directory while its run is active. Reject this placement or distinguish automatic directories and use the same lock protocol; add a concurrent pruning test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM75QHSo","finding_digest":"0222f837a286f1dfbb33cf815e5beac15718e9628fa3b9740351cb09be160d3a","finding_id":"arf_v1_airpqn5cq3y57oztz6av4w7kyf","finding_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/run.py::prepare_out::active-output-directory-deletion","identity_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/run.py::prepare_out::active-output-directory-deletion","line":1068,"observation_digest":"cb3774e6ea6e173c77cdb73218a41ecc4697632ca6365ba270177a37b458acf0","observation_id":"aro_v1_zm3xjzxknylty56nw4zbrja6zr","path":".github/scripts/js_examples/run.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_airpqn5cq3y57oztz6av4w7kyf","published_at":"2026-10-05T07:49:50Z","review_id":"arr_v1_lsjtv47drrinlxltegbpdkzd5v","reviewed_base_sha":"631b78d1b505b157eee758662291fc5e2353bbb6","reviewed_head_sha":"64135ddf7c7a779190dcc96159d210359736d153","reviewer":"codex","start_line":1068,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":745},"record_id":"art_v1_okhdpeawteophopder53kwtkn3","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-05T07:49:50Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
